Package: perufaunads004
Title: Taxonomic Validation and Reconciliation of Threatened Fauna of Peru
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Paul E.",
           family = "Santos Andrade",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "paulefrens@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: Tools for taxonomic validation and reconciliation of scientific names 
    of threatened and legally protected wildlife species in Peru, based on Supreme 
    Decree No. 004-2014-MINAGRI and the Red Book of Threatened Wildlife of Peru 
    (SERFOR, 2018). Provides taxonomic name parsing, a hierarchical matching engine 
    (exact, synonym, fuzzy, and genus-level), and structured access to conservation 
    technical sheets.
